+    Like the kpool tail it opts out of prefix caching: the pool is uncached, and
+    the opt-out keeps its (smaller) block size out of the hash-block gcd and the
+    engine's ``cache_config.block_size``. After a prefix-cache hit the drafter's
+    blocks start fresh, so drafts read unwritten context for up to one window;
+    the target verifies every draft, so the output does not change.
